<title>INDONESIA: Tubindo 1996 net rises to 14.21 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Tubindo 1996 net rises to 14.21 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			14.21 vs 1.27</p>
<p>    Net sales				67.63 vs 42.85</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     12.21 vs 949 million rph</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries			 3.12 vs 0</p>
<p>(from sale of unused fixed assets)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	 316  vs 28</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		     16.29 vs 2.99</p>
<p>Note: PT Citra Tubindo is a manufacturer of tubular goods and of couplings and accessories.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
